$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Kov" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> In the frozen hills of Kov the <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> setup a sort of trading post so that they both may prosper.  However old arguments die hard and this is no exception.  What started as meaningless bickering has escalated into all out war.  The trade tunnels that once allowed a free flow of goods from each base are now liabilities to be guarded at all costs.  The surface entrances are not to be ignored however.  Claim the enemy flag 5 times to declare your team the victor and run the enemy out.";
